{"count":1,"next":null,"previous":null,"results":[{"code":"EMSR679","name":"Wildfire in Thessaly region, Greece","reason":"On 26 July 2023 at 10:30 UTC, a wildfire took place in an agricultural area near Agios Georgios Feron village in Thessaly region, Greece. The fire is ongoing and it is burning forest and agricultural areas. Residents of the villages Paliouri, Dimini, Melissatika, Kritharia, Maratho, Velanidia, Panagia and Chrissi Akti were ordered to evacuate. The industrial area of the city of Volos was also evacuated. According to the Hellenic Fire Service, 72 firefighters are currently operating in the area, assisted by 1 ground force group, 38 vehicles, 5 water-bombing aircraft and 2 helicopters. Volunteers and municipality staff are helping out during the emergency as well. Copernicus EMS Rapid Mapping is requested to provide an initial rough estimation, wildfire extent, and damage assessment emergency mapping.","category":"Wildfire","subCategory":"Forest fire","sensitive":false,"reportLink":"https://storymaps.arcgis.com/stories/4bec25b9dc554302bd15813a3c1dc52a","activator":"Greece|General secretariat for Civil protection - Directorate for Emergency Planning and Response","eventTime":"2023-07-26T10:30:00","activationTime":"2023-07-27T10:55:00","closed":true,"gdacsId":null,"continent":"Europe","countries":[{"name":"Greece"}],"aois":[{"name":"Agios Georgios Feron","extent":"POLYGON ((22.947388 39.331634, 22.953237 39.289358, 22.866009 39.283221, 22.823258 39.273082, 22.81648 39.23507, 22.634477 39.227199, 22.61971 39.44815, 22.68236001260702 39.44772071612788, 22.68236 39.447721, 22.819187380836183 39.446783161927954, 22.986751 39.445635, 22.947388 39.331634))","number":1,"activationCode":"EMSR679","products":[{"id":182,"type":"DEL","monitoring":true,"monitoringNumber":1,"feasible":false,"images":[{"uuid":"ca36428d-8e75-431a-9bfa-bfb5884a9036","new":true,"sensorType":"optical","sensorName":"GeoEye-1","resolutionClass":"VHR2","acquisitionTime":"2023-07-29T09:3